    "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
    "notes": "Derived and modified from the geo reference data vendored in datatug/datatug-demo-project (itself vendored from ingitdb/geo-ingitdb at a874fb0a95183f536cb574a5ccb45e362274eb6d). Country names, ISO codes, continent, capital, area, currency, calling code, TLD and GeoName ID come from GeoNames countryInfo.txt (CC BY 4.0); population is the latest World Bank SP.POP.TOTL observation (CC BY 4.0) with its year; 36 territories have no World Bank observation and keep a NULL population. The undated GeoNames population is not published. Aliases are hand-checked DataTug mapping data. scripts/rebuild-source.py rebuilds the SQLite fixture from the pinned recipe inputs and CI compares its full logical contents with the committed file; SQLite file bytes can vary by SQLite library version. Neither GeoNames nor the World Bank endorses this database. The sha256 identifies the generated SQLite fixture at data-source/source.sqlite; recipe inputs are identified separately by the provider manifest."
